<title>USA: ATHLETICS-FRIDAY'S RESULTS AT THE U.S. COLLEGIATE CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-FRIDAY'S RESULTS AT THE U.S. COLLEGIATE CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
